    "max_time_steps": 240,
    "description": "Level 2: the provided narrow-bridge case, scaled. One capacity-1 bridge of weight 12 is the short way to the station; a two-hop detour costs 14. Three units, six pods, and the bridge is shared by loaded outbound and empty returning traffic. Punishes wait-when-blocked: the queue behind the bridge grows to 24+ steps while a 14-step detour sits unused. This is the single highest-value congestion lesson in the whole set."
